# Layer 3 — ban list (EXAMPLE; copy to hash_banlist.txt).
#
# A hit here is BLOCKED and COUNTS AGAINST THE PUBLISHER: it raises
# csam_attempts and counts toward publisher_attempt_disconnect_threshold.
# This list is therefore for material whose publisher should answer for it —
# child sexual abuse material and bestiality alike. The file used to be called
# csam_hashes.txt, which was inaccurate once the second category went in.
#
# Anything that should merely disappear from the index — decoys, takedown
# requests — belongs in hash_filter.txt instead, where the publisher is not
# accused. Mixing the two dilutes a list whose whole value is that every entry
# means one specific thing.
#
